      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The intercepted comms contain specific clauses within the restructuring memos explicitly referencing the suspension of our shared tariff framework, moving beyond standard market shifts toward a formal exit. While this indicates a genuine threat rather than a diplomatic crisis due to \"compliance,\" the precise wording in the intercepted files must be vetted by legal counsel within the next hour to determine the exact timing of their intent. Proceeding with a report that labels this \"strategic intervention\" without those specific legal citations could indeed escalate tensions prematurely.",
